## Plans (optional, helps codex-plan-ledger)

When you output a `<proposed_plan>`, add a `## Decisions` section. One list item per
decision the user should confirm, with 2-3 options as sub-items, `(Recommended)` after
the option you suggest, and an `Affects:` sub-item listing the files or globs that the
decision changes. Keep the rest of the plan in the normal format.
